  concept: 'Authored objective: Repair three independent hardware faults.

    Authored
    requirement: Repair Q1 pump loss, R1 reference drift and TH1 outlet intermittency.
    Requalify after each.

    General teaching principle: Troubleshooting compares
    fresh evidence with a known reference, isolates likely causes, repairs the supported
    issue and retests.

    Only fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish
    that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: Debugging a chain is easier when each link is tested before replacing
    the next.
